      <pre class="p-4 text-sm font-mono text-cyan-300 overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed"><code># JVM arguments for sub-millisecond ZGC pause time
java -XX:+UseZGC -XX:+ZGenerational \\
     -Xms64g -Xmx64g \\
     -XX:+UnlockDiagnosticVMOptions \\
     -XX:GuaranteedSafepointInterval=0 \\
     -jar backend-service.jar</code></pre>
